@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
left to right direction
rectangle "물리 root\n(sourceTag, sourceEpoch, sampleId)\n+ 원래 timestamp" as P
rectangle "내부 window U\nover 2 ms" as U
rectangle "외부 window W\nover 10 ms" as W
P --> U : sample (0,0) (1,10) (2,20)
U --> W : derived event (site, revision)\n값 0, 5, 15\nquality 3 + U의 site
note bottom of W
  derived event 3개의 평균 = 20/3
  (평탄화한 물리 leaf의 10이 아님)
  결과 품질: Derived (3)
end note
@enduml
